   ✋ ConstraintError: a crash on this box leaves no core systemd-coredump can show
      ⇒ core_pattern: core
      ⇒ the next tmux segfault would be guessed at, never read
      fix: sudo -v && rhx grove.provision --what 1.6.8.coredump --mode apply
           (on a grove: run it on the ground seat, which holds sudo)
